OL,3,AThousands of illegal ghost plates on
OL,4,Acars revealed by new cameras
OL,5,
OL,6,FIllegal plates are putting the public
OL,7,Fat risk and are far too easy to get
OL,8,Fhold of, according to one former
OL,9,Fgovernment advisor.
OL,11,FWe have spoken to families who say
OL,12,Ftheir lives have been devastated by
OL,13,Froad deaths where illegal plates were
OL,14,Finvolved.
